    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYTEST STATUS: We're currently collecting playtest requests for future testing phases. While we're not approving new testers immediately, we'll notify you when you're granted access. By requesting access now, you'll be in the queue for when we expand our testing group. Thank you for your interest in Five More Minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/79d8b296b5958e825b2f14dc14d4d77b.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.poster.avif?t=1754114932\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.webm?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.mp4?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck and strategize to defeat foes as you traverse videogame worlds. Choose between 3 unique starting genres, and combine them to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five more minutes is a love letter to growing up with the emotional support of our best friend: videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/d4e0cbb21bc0a99d66a4596dfd82d833.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef5d3c3e0bb4cf477cd5c37a54f8e500.poster.avif?t=1754114932\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef5d3c3e0bb4cf477cd5c37a54f8e500.webm?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef5d3c3e0bb4cf477cd5c37a54f8e500.mp4?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each genre has its own set of unique cards, keepsakes, and strategies. Level up your character to gain more actions, health, and collect powerful mementos from your gaming adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ae639fb935a7d2e9de8a9456c12306b3.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/6a5772ca8c280776c71649cae4907836.poster.avif?t=1754114932\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/6a5772ca8c280776c71649cae4907836.webm?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/6a5772ca8c280776c71649cae4907836.mp4?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse genres to unlock powerful and forbidden combinations that break the rules of gaming... or the game itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/a5051454cd3599abd9b5d92104d9dad2.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/285a11bcaee8376bb338d3dc84883d5c.poster.avif?t=1754114932\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/285a11bcaee8376bb338d3dc84883d5c.webm?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/285a11bcaee8376bb338d3dc84883d5c.mp4?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through nostalgic worlds loaded directly from the memory cards of your gaming childhood!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYTEST STATUS: We're currently collecting playtest requests for future testing phases. While we're not approving new testers immediately, we'll notify you when you're granted access. By requesting access now, you'll be in the queue for when we expand our testing group. Thank you for your interest in Five More Minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/79d8b296b5958e825b2f14dc14d4d77b.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.poster.avif?t=1754114932\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.webm?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/ef75c0d55084f52150c00044cc088af8.mp4?t=1754114932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck and strategize to defeat foes as you traverse videogame worlds. Choose between 3 unique starting genres, and combine them to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five more minutes is a love letter to growing up with the emotional support of our best friend: videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/d4e0cbb21bc0a99d66a4596dfd82d833.avif?t=1754114932\" data-has-big width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct